Hi, I’ve implemented a solution for this issue:

-> Enabled scrolling in the left section while keeping it sticky.
-> Synchronized the left section's scroll with the right section using the following approach:

```
const leftSection = document.getElementById("left-section");
const rightSection = document.getElementById("right-section");

leftSection.addEventListener("wheel", (event) => {
  rightSection.scrollBy({
    top: event.deltaY,
  });
});
```
Additionally, I adjusted the overscroll-behavior for the right section to none for better UX and to maintain synchronized scroll.

**Please assign this issue to me so I can create a pull request with the fix. Let me know if any additional changes are required. Thank you!**
